  "limits": "No ladders, swimming, slopes speed changes or stairs stepping. The collision shape is not resized when crouching; only the head moves, and the stand-up test checks the space above the current shape. Mouse look runs only while the mouse is captured. Verified with Godot 4.7.2 headless; written against the Godot 4.3 API.",
